  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Matrices : Déterminant d'une matrice (3×3)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<div style="background: #475569; border-left: 5px solid #334155; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; padding: 10px 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><strong style="font-weight: 800; color: #fff; font-size: .95rem;">Matrices — Déterminant 3×3</strong> <span style="background: #334155; color: #fff; padding: 2px 9px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: bold;">/ 1 pt</span></div>
<p>Soit la matrice :</p>
<div style="text-align: center; margin: 15px 0;">\(M = {@M@}\)</div>
<p><strong>Calculer</strong> le déterminant de \(M\) (par la règle de Sarrus ou par développement).</p>
<div style="margin: 10px 0;">\(\det(M) = \) [[input:ans_det]] [[validation:ans_det]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<div style="margin-top: 20px; padding: 15px; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px;">
<div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">🔑 Correction détaillée — Règle de Sarrus</div>
<div style="font-size: .9rem;">
<strong style="color: #15803d;">Diagonales descendantes (signe +) :</strong><br>
• {@a11@} × {@a22@} × {@a33@} = {@p1@}<br>
• {@a12@} × {@a23@} × {@a31@} = {@p2@}<br>
• {@a13@} × {@a21@} × {@a32@} = {@p3@}<br>
\(S_1 = {@p1@} + {@p2@} + {@p3@} = {@S1@}\)<br><br>
<strong style="color: #dc2626;">Diagonales montantes (signe −) :</strong><br>
• {@a13@} × {@a22@} × {@a31@} = {@n1@}<br>
• {@a11@} × {@a23@} × {@a32@} = {@n2@}<br>
• {@a12@} × {@a21@} × {@a33@} = {@n3@}<br>
\(S_2 = {@n1@} + {@n2@} + {@n3@} = {@S2@}\)<br><br>
\[
\det(M) = S_1 - S_2 = {@S1@} - {@S2@} = {@det_correct@}
\]
</div>
</div>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
